<title>USA: HCC to acquire Continental Aviation.</title>
<headline>HCC to acquire Continental Aviation.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HCC Insurance Holdings Inc said on Monday it agreed to acquire Continental Aviation Underwriters Inc for cash and stock.</p>
<p>The exact terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Continental, an agency located in Memphis, Tenn., would continue to be run by E.R. Kinnebrew III, its founder and president, HCC said in a news release.</p>
<p>Continental underwrites general aviation insurance, with estimated 1997 premiums of $20 million, HCC said.</p>
</text>
